无活动时，各科目的头 部背景颜色为

![](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/core/api/resources/img/5eecdaf48460cde55779fa9f7a914b2ccf8d309c55fc710875b8339e1c4c2483d23cd25c3e4de2798d68742cd653602afa4cc552274ccc035f954fba65f6175d02e3b9380209c280ce935b4115f15f25825342b38b835525b9cbd007c8a55206?tmpCode=7fc8e1cb-e10d-4945-b85d-c5e3433533b8)

可参考方案：取活动落地页头部底纹样式调整不透明度，通过混合模式“颜色”叠加各科目主色，达到理想效果，科目主色如下。

![](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/core/api/resources/img/5eecdaf48460cde55779fa9f7a914b2ccf8d309c55fc710875b8339e1c4c2483d23cd25c3e4de2798d68742cd653602a15464a86392b1bf5c519dd9abbee9490ce9942db0c7afd515b5c3cbac9dd84a845aff6b161cd607087f032c574ba682e?tmpCode=7fc8e1cb-e10d-4945-b85d-c5e3433533b8)

